{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"f000000000000000","type":"group","x":-30,"y":-60,"width":360,"height":960,"label":"Tier 0: Tensor & Spatial Mechanics","color":"5"},
		{"id":"f000000000000001","type":"group","x":410,"y":-60,"width":360,"height":960,"label":"Tier 1: Formulation, Losses & Metrics","color":"1"},
		{"id":"f000000000000002","type":"group","x":850,"y":-60,"width":360,"height":960,"label":"Tier 2: Classic CNN Architectures","color":"2"},
		{"id":"f000000000000003","type":"group","x":1290,"y":-60,"width":360,"height":960,"label":"Tier 3: Attention & Transformer Paradigms","color":"6"},
		{"id":"f000000000000004","type":"group","x":1730,"y":-60,"width":360,"height":960,"label":"Tier 4: Architecture Engineering & Craft","color":"4"},
		{"id":"a000000000000001","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":300,"height":140,"color":"5","text":"### 0.1 Representasi Tensor 4D\n- Struktur input: `(B, C, H, W)`\n- Transformasi channel & spatial resolution\n- Memori footprint aktivasi ($O(B \\cdot C \\cdot H \\cdot W)$)"},
		{"id":"a000000000000002","type":"text","x":0,"y":180,"width":300,"height":140,"color":"5","text":"### 0.2 Operasi Konvolusi Spasial\n- Kernel ($k$), Stride ($s$), Padding ($p$)\n- Formula shape: $\\lfloor (I-k+2p)/s \\rfloor + 1$\n- Dilation rate ($d$) & konvolusi atrous"},
		{"id":"a000000000000003","type":"text","x":0,"y":360,"width":300,"height":140,"color":"5","text":"### 0.3 Receptive Field (ERF)\n- Teori Effective Receptive Field\n- Teori konteks lokal vs global\n- Dampak stacking konvolusi terhadap cakupan piksel"},
		{"id":"a000000000000004","type":"text","x":0,"y":540,"width":300,"height":140,"color":"5","text":"### 0.4 Downsampling & Bottlenecking\n- Max pooling vs Strided convolution\n- Trade-off abstraksi semantik vs hilangnya detail spasial/tepi objek"},
		{"id":"a000000000000005","type":"text","x":0,"y":720,"width":300,"height":150,"color":"5","text":"### 0.5 Teknik Upsampling\n- Interpolasi (Bilinear, Nearest)\n- Transposed Convolution (`ConvTranspose2d` & checkerboard artifact)\n- Sub-pixel Convolution (`PixelShuffle`)"},
		{"id":"b000000000000001","type":"text","x":440,"y":0,"width":300,"height":150,"color":"1","text":"### 1.1 Formulasi Dense Prediction\n- Pemetaan per-piksel: $\\mathbb{R}^{B \\times 3 \\times H \\times W} \\to \\mathbb{R}^{B \\times K \\times H \\times W}$\n- Perbedaan fundamental dengan klasifikasi citra & object detection"},
		{"id":"b000000000000002","type":"text","x":440,"y":190,"width":300,"height":150,"color":"1","text":"### 1.2 Taksonomi Segmentasi\n- **Semantic:** label kelas per piksel tanpa identitas objek\n- **Instance:** membedakan objek individual\n- **Panoptic:** gabungan 'stuff' + 'things'"},
		{"id":"b000000000000003","type":"text","x":440,"y":380,"width":300,"height":180,"color":"1","text":"### 1.3 Loss Functions Khusus\n- Cross-Entropy (per-pixel BCE/CCE)\n- Masalah class imbalance ekstrem\n- Soft-Dice Loss & Tversky Index\n- Focal Loss (modulasi easy vs hard pixels)\n- Weighted Combo Loss (CE + Dice)"},
		{"id":"b000000000000004","type":"text","x":440,"y":600,"width":300,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"### 1.4 Metrik Evaluasi\n- Jaccard Index (IoU & mean IoU)\n- Dice Similarity Coefficient (F1-score)\n- Metrik batas: Boundary IoU & Hausdorff Distance (HD95)"},
		{"id":"c000000000000001","type":"text","x":880,"y":0,"width":300,"height":140,"color":"2","text":"### 2.1 Fully Convolutional Networks (FCN)\n- Mengganti FC dense layer dengan konvolusi $1 \\times 1$\n- Transposed conv upsampling\n- Konsep early skip fusion (FCN-32s, 16s, 8s)"},
		{"id":"c000000000000002","type":"text","x":880,"y":180,"width":300,"height":150,"color":"2","text":"### 2.2 U-Net Arsitektur Kanonik\n- Simetris Encoder-Decoder path\n- Concatenation skip connections\n- Rekonstruksi kontur detail lokal\n- Variasi: UNet++, ResUNet"},
		{"id":"c000000000000003","type":"text","x":880,"y":370,"width":300,"height":140,"color":"2","text":"### 2.3 Context: PSPNet (PPM)\n- Pyramid Pooling Module\n- Multi-scale pooling grid ($1\\times 1, 2\\times 2, 3\\times 3, 6\\times 6$)\n- Ekstraksi konteks global tanpa kehilangan lokal"},
		{"id":"c000000000000004","type":"text","x":880,"y":550,"width":300,"height":150,"color":"2","text":"### 2.4 DeepLab Family (ASPP)\n- Atrous Spatial Pyramid Pooling (ASPP)\n- Multi-rate dilated convolutions\n- Menangkap multi-scale context tanpa downsampling berlebih\n- DeepLabv3+ decoder"},
		{"id":"c000000000000005","type":"text","x":880,"y":740,"width":300,"height":140,"color":"2","text":"### 2.5 Feature Pyramid Networks (FPN)\n- Top-down pathway & lateral connections\n- Additive feature fusion\n- Prediksi multi-skala efisien"},
		{"id":"d000000000000001","type":"text","x":1320,"y":0,"width":300,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### 3.1 Mekanisme Attention pada CNN\n- Attention U-Net (Attention Gates)\n- CBAM (Channel + Spatial Attention)\n- Menekan respons background yang tidak relevan di skip-connection"},
		{"id":"d000000000000002","type":"text","x":1320,"y":200,"width":300,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### 3.2 Vision Transformers (ViT & SegFormer)\n- Hierarchical Transformer encoder (Mix-FFN)\n- Windowed attention (Swin-UNet)\n- Lightweight All-MLP decoder\n- Long-range dependency modeling"},
		{"id":"d000000000000003","type":"text","x":1320,"y":400,"width":300,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### 3.3 Paradigma Mask Classification\n- Pergeseran dari per-pixel ke set prediction\n- Mask2Former (Masked-attention query)\n- Bipartite matching via Hungarian Loss\n- Arsitektur terpadu untuk Semantic + Instance"},
		{"id":"d000000000000004","type":"text","x":1320,"y":600,"width":300,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"### 3.4 Foundation Models (SAM)\n- Segment Anything Model (SAM)\n- Promptable segmentation (points, boxes, text)\n- Heavy Image Encoder + Light Mask Decoder\n- Zero-shot segmentation & fine-tuning"},
		{"id":"e000000000000001","type":"text","x":1760,"y":80,"width":300,"height":180,"color":"4","text":"### 4.1 Desain Arsitektur Modular (PyTorch)\n- Pemisahan komponen: Backbone, Neck, Decoder, Segmentation Head\n- Menulis `nn.Module` bersih: `ConvBlock`, `ResidualBlock`, `DecoderBlock`\n- Pengujian shape assertion di setiap forward pass"},
		{"id":"e000000000000002","type":"text","x":1760,"y":320,"width":300,"height":180,"color":"4","text":"### 4.2 Optimasi VRAM & Engineering\n- Menghadapi VRAM bottleneck aktivasi resolusi tinggi\n- Mixed Precision (AMP / `torch.cuda.amp`)\n- Gradient / Activation Checkpointing\n- Inference patch-based / Sliding-window tiling"},
		{"id":"e000000000000003","type":"text","x":1760,"y":560,"width":300,"height":180,"color":"4","text":"### 4.3 Rekayasa Arsitektur Custom\n- Mengganti backbone (ResNet -> ConvNeXt/PVT)\n- Merancang bottleneck custom (Hybrid CNN-Attention)\n- Menyesuaikan arsitektur dengan domain data (citra medis, satelit, drone)"}
	],
